{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sweet Disco - A simple and beautiful jigsaw puzzle game with the theme of disco. It tells the story of five pretty and cute girls after they get drunk at a disco. It is accompanied by relaxing music. After completing the level, you can enjoy the girls' photos in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The game has three levels of difficulty: 2x2, 2x4, 4x4 puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Press &quot;F&quot; to turn on black and white when doing puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Players can complete the puzzle by pressing the 'Blank' key during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Players can quickly view girl pictures by pressing the AD key, left and right keys or the left and right keys of the mouse in the gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Puzzle image size is 800x960 px</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Gallery image size is 1088x960 px</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609520?t=1742527822","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609520?t=1742527822","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609520/881550cc2b0e233ec51911f25d5dc7518ed45f55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742527822","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609520/881550cc2b0e233ec51911f25d5dc7518ed45f55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742527822","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"- Nudity or pornographic content\r\n- Sexual assault/non-consensual sex\r\n- Alcohol abuse\r\n- Contains female masturbation content\r\n- Clear depiction of male/female reproductive organs\r\n- Not suitable for viewing at work\r\n- Not suitable for all ages\r\n- All characters in the game are over 18 years old"},"detailed_descri